{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>ועמוד הענן יומם.</b> You will not find the word יומם in all of Scripture except when the sun is upon the earth, but the word יום you will find in the Torah, in the Prophets, and in the Writings meaning night. In the Torah: ״ביום הכותי כל בכור״ — and that was at night. In the Prophets: ״היום יום בשורה״, and there it is written ״וחכינו עד אור הבקר״. In the Writings: ״יום צעקתי בלילה נגדך״." "<b>לא ימיש.</b> Like לא מש, as in ״ומשרתו יהושע בן נון נער לא ימיש״."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {0 "The Hebrew text begins with ו before עמוד, though the lemma head as given lacks it; the vav is included in the translation following the source."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:57:44.129702822Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}